            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Fifty percent relative humidity, measured by a separate hygrometer placed in the dampest corner rather than by the machine's own readout. Because the unit's sensor reads the driest air in the room, achieving 50 percent in the far corner usually means setting the dial somewhere between 40 and 45."
